## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Zero Re-Fetch Guarantee**:
> With these changes:
> - Once SEC filings are downloaded for a company, they are never re-fetched unless explicitly requested via "Fetch Fresh SEC".
> - Once an earnings call transcript is fetched for a quarter (e.g. `AVGO_2026Q1`), it is saved to disk (`backend/transcript_cache/`) and reloaded in 0ms without consuming search API credits.
> - Once a Deep Analysis is executed, its full artifact (agent reports, debate transcript, and raw transcripts) is preserved on disk and auto-loaded on page refresh.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Auto-Load on Page Refresh**:
> When entering Deep Analysis or refreshing the browser, if past analysis runs exist for the active ticker, the UI will **automatically display the most recent analysis run** (with a clear header: *"Viewing archived analysis from [Date] · [Run Fresh Analysis]"*). The user will no longer see a blank form or need to manually hunt for past runs in the sidebar.

