## Open Questions

> [!NOTE]
> 1. **Data Copilot Fallback Priority**: When Data Copilot or Ask AI receives an earnings-call question, we propose reading from:
>    - (1) In-memory `debate_store` (fastest if hot),
>    - (2) On-disk `analysis_history/{TICKER}_{run_id}.json` (full report & transcripts),
>    - (3) On-disk `transcript_cache/{TICKER}_*.json` (raw transcripts).
>    This ensures answers are always provided if data has ever been fetched.

